      "body": "I know Im very organised 😜\nWe are thinking (mum, dad, big sis, little sis and her family(5), Joseph and I and maybe my aunt and uncle) of going to\nMamore lodge\nnext summer for maybe 2 weeks. there will be 12 of us!!!)\nWe have been here 3 times before and always enjoyed our holidays here, last time we went was in 1998.  It is a beautiful hotel with self catering lodges situated half way up a mountain on the West Highland way.  It is the last stretch to Fort Wiliiam.\nI have emailed asking what lodges they still have as the one we had before isnt mentioned 🙁  (fingers crossed it is still there 😀",
